shortdesc Reorder frames in the PDF file
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides a method to reorder frames in the PDF file
longdesc without reordering the source. Its principal use is to embed or
longdesc append frames with details on some subject. The author
longdesc describes the package as "experimental".
